@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081

### Create (201); repeat unchanged with the same key for 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: example-order-001

{
  "customerId": "f90c8ab2-5acf-4b35-8ec3-917167624075",
  "currency": "EUR",
  "items": [{"productId": "sku-1", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 12.50}]
}

### Filter and paginate
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?customerId=f90c8ab2-5acf-4b35-8ec3-917167624075&status=PENDING&page=0&size=20

### Replace the ID with the value returned by POST
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Conflict (409) after creating the example above
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: example-order-001

{
  "customerId": "f90c8ab2-5acf-4b35-8ec3-917167624075",
  "currency": "EUR",
  "items": [{"productId": "sku-1", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 13.00}]
}

### Validation (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: invalid-example

{"items": []}
